Untitled UI PRO
---------------
This package includes components from Untitled UI React PRO, used under the
Untitled UI licence (https://www.untitledui.com/license). They live under:

- src/components/application/command-menus
- src/components/application/modal-layouts
- src/components/application/notifications
- src/components/application/tree-view
- src/components/shared-assets

and each file opens with a comment saying so. That licence does not permit
exposing their source code publicly or redistributing them as a UI kit or
library. This repository must therefore remain private, and
its source may be shared only with people who hold their own Untitled UI
licence.

Third-party components
----------------------
Third-party code in this repository stays under its own licence:

- Untitled UI React (free components, vendored under src/components/base,
  src/components/foundations, src/components/application except the PRO
  folders listed above, and src/styles/uui-theme.css): MIT License,
  Copyright (c) Untitled UI.
  https://github.com/untitleduico/react/blob/main/LICENSE
- Geist and Geist Mono fonts (public/fonts, copied into dist/lib/fonts by the
  library build): SIL Open Font License 1.1, Copyright (c) Vercel.
- Icon assets under public/assets keep the licence of their upstream icon set,
  as recorded by each Ichava icon pack.
